  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Explore Web Lab\r\n\r\n- Take **5 minutes** to explore Web Lab.\r\n- Select the various tabs and see what you can discover. For example, can you figure out how to get AI to make changes to the page?\r\n- Don’t worry — you can't break anything!\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "teacher_markdown": "- Encourage students to try out as many buttons and features as they can.\r\n- Students should discover:\r\n  - Instructions\r\n  - File panel\r\n  - `index.html` file\r\n  - `style.css` file\r\n  - `images` folder with images within\r\n  - Code/Preview/Split View tabs\r\n  - AI Tutor\r\n\r\n\r\n",
    "submittable": "true",
    "disable_edit_run_for_submission": "false",
    "hide_share_and_remix": "false",
    "widget_view": "false",
